  "notes": [
    "Coords are raw brig.glb-local (bow +Z, up +Y, starboard +X). Crew parent to the ship node so they inherit the controller's transform.",
    "Three deck levels: waist y4.0 (z-4.9..8), quarterdeck y5.0 (z-12.4..-4.9), forecastle y5.0 (z8..12.4). Lerp Y along edges; the two breaks use 'ladder' edges.",
    "4 guns/side at z 9.0 (forecastle), 1.5 (waist), -6.5 & -9.0 (quarterdeck); gun stations sit ~0.5m inboard (x +-2.2) of the muzzle and face outboard so Work_Cannon's reach lands on the carriage.",
    "Two masts get climb paths each side; the ratline base is at the channels (x +-2.9..3.0) and rises inboard to the top (ForeCap y13.4 / MainCap y15.4).",
    "max_crew_suggested: 12 (helm, up to 8 guns, ropes x2-4, lookout, climbers). FIRST PASS from measured landmarks \u2014 refine waypoint Y for deck sheer + dodge the hatches/capstan/gratings if crew clip through deck fittings."
  ]
